          <b>P1 - A/B Testing Framework:</b> Simulate A/B tests with configurable sample size, effect size, significance level. Compute power curves. Frequentist and Bayesian approaches side by side. Visualize results.<br>
          <b>P2 - Distribution Visualizer:</b> Interactive tool to explore all major distributions. Adjust parameters, see PDF/CDF change in real time. Overlay multiple distributions. Show CLT convergence animation.<br>
          <b>P3 - Monte Carlo Simulator:</b> Estimate pi, option prices (Black-Scholes), game outcomes, and integrals using Monte Carlo methods. Convergence analysis. Variance reduction techniques.<br>
          <b>P4 - Statistical Hypothesis Tester:</b> Upload a dataset, select columns, choose test type. Automatically checks assumptions (normality, equal variance). Runs appropriate test, reports results with plain-English interpretation.<br>
          <b>P5 - Bayesian Inference Engine:</b> Implement Bayesian updating for coin flip, A/B testing, and linear regression. Visualize prior, likelihood, and posterior evolution as data arrives. MCMC sampler (Metropolis-Hastings) from scratch.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

